-      Witness (gTop (k + 1)) σ ∧
-      (∀ d, (carrier P hnext).grade d.1 = k + 1 → q d ≤ M) ∧
-      ∀ d, σ (source P hk hnext a d.1) = min (q d) M := by
-  obtain ⟨a₀, _⟩ := F.exists_rank_anchor (Nat.succ_pos k) (F.zero_admissible (k + 1))
