+    · simpa only [hea] using hQ
+    · simpa only [hex] using And.intro hface hfaceQ
+    · change restrictPlan P (((A ∪ {x}).erase x).erase a) =
+        restrictPlan Q (((A ∪ {x}).erase x).erase a)
+      rw [hex, hres]
